Note that, if, at the start of the Player Turn a Unit includes any Models that do not have this Special Rule, then this Special Rule has no effect on that Unit for the duration of that Player Turn regardless of how many other Models in the Unit may have any variant of this Special Rule.</description></rule><rule id="89b5-7320-db15-fd60" name="Feel No Pain (5+)" hidden="false" page="299"><description>**Feel No Pain (X) is a Damage Mitigation Test that may be taken in addition to a Saving Throw.**

